      "name": "Recurvirostra",
      "rank": "GENUS",
      "description": "Elegant pied waders with distinctively upturned bills swept through shallow water to catch invertebrates. The Pied Avocet breeds in shallow saline lagoons in southern Sweden — Öland and Gotland — and is expanding northward.",
